{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1123409001:1":{"text":"どうした友よ、顔色が良くないようだが……","source_cn":"朋友们，你们看起来脸色不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAECFFDAE913ECD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123409002:1":{"text":"ハサールさんがウルサスに絡まれて、住んでた場所から出て行ったんです……","source_cn":"有些熊人过来骚扰哈什尔，然后他就离开这里了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1DFA81818C7DAAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123409003:1":{"text":"なるほど。彼はもう縄張りから出ていったのだな。","source_cn":"原来如此，他已经离开这片领地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE4198A7C5FFA12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1123409003":{"text":"なるほど。彼はもう縄張りから出ていったのだな。","source_cn":"原来如此，他已经离开这片领地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE4198A7C5FFA12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123409004:1":{"text":"うむ、変化の兆しは現れ始めているが、俺が目指しているものとはまだほど遠い。","source_cn":"唉，虽然目前部落的改革虽然有所起色，但离我想看到的程度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D24A9A571991A3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c